{"status": 200, "url_final": "https://niki-site.vercel.app/", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <meta\n      name=\"description\"\n      content=\"Four independent LLM agents plan, code, test, and review in hermetic sandboxes \u2014 then hand you a verified niki/<id> branch with a full audit trail. Open source, BYOK, no telemetry.\"\n    />\n    <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n    <meta name=\"google-site-verification\" content=\"SjF9gqoQELFWR3wc2VUf91JHtxp5xJNkpbylNUGP-Hk\" />\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#f7f2ea\" />\n    <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://niki-site.vercel.app/\" />\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\" />\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.svg\" />\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\" />\n\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"Niki\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"website\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Niki \u00b7 Multi-agent coding pipeline that ships verified pull requests\" />\n    <meta\n      property=\"og:description\"\n      content=\"Four independent LLM agents plan, code, test, and review in hermetic sandboxes \u2014 then hand you a verified niki/<id> branch with a full audit trail. Open source, BYOK, no telemetry.\"\n    />\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://niki-site.vercel.app/\" />\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://niki-site.vercel.app/og-image.png\" />\n  <meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" />\n\n    <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Niki \u00b7 Multi-agent coding pipeline that ships verified pull requests\" />\n    <meta\n      name=\"twitter:description\"\n      content=\"Four independent LLM agents plan, code, test, and review in hermetic sandboxes \u2014 then hand you a verified niki/<id> branch with a full audit trail. Open source, BYOK, no telemetry.\"\n    />\n    <meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://niki-site.vercel.app/og-image.png\" />\n\n    <title>Niki \u00b7 Multi-agent coding pipeline that ships verified pull requests</title>\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n      {\n        \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n        \"@graph\": [\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#organization\",\n            \"name\": \"Niki\",\n            \"url\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/\",\n            \"logo\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/favicon.svg\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"WebSite\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#website\",\n            \"url\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/\",\n            \"name\": \"Niki\",\n            \"description\": \"Marketing site for Niki, a hermetic multi-agent AI coding system.\",\n            \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#organization\" }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"SoftwareApplication\",\n\"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#software\",\n            \"name\": \"Niki\",\n                \"applicationCategory\": \"DeveloperApplication\",\n            \"operatingSystem\": \"Linux, macOS, Windows\",\n            \"url\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/\",\n            \"downloadUrl\": \"https://github.com/RavaniRoshan/niki/releases\",\n            \"softwareRequirements\": \"Rust 2024 edition; Podman or Docker\",\n            \"description\": \"Four independent LLM agents plan, code, test, and review in hermetic sandboxes \u2014 then hand you a verified niki/<id> branch with a full audit trail. Open source, BYOK, no telemetry.\",\n            \"publisher\": { \"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#organization\" },\n            \"offers\": {\n              \"@type\": \"Offer\",\n              \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\",\n              \"url\": \"https://github.com/RavaniRoshan/niki\"\n            }\n          },\n          {\n            \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n            \"@id\": \"https://niki-site.vercel.app/#faq\",\n            \"mainEntity\": [\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Does Niki touch my working tree?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"No. Agents run against a copy inside a sandbox, using Podman or Docker by default, or git worktree isolation. You review a niki/id branch and merge on your terms.\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Do I need a Niki API key?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"No bundled gateway is required. Bring Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, or Ollama keys, with environment variables available for secret management.\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"Can each agent use a different model?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"Yes. Teams can assign provider and model per agent, such as a stronger reasoning model for planning and review and a lower-cost model for testing.\"\n                }\n              },\n              {\n                \"@type\": \"Question\",\n                \"name\": \"How do I install Niki?\",\n                \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n                  \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n                  \"text\": \"Prebuilt binaries for x86_64 Linux, ARM64 Linux, x86_64 Windows, x86_64 macOS, and Apple Silicon macOS are available now via GitHub Releases, alongside a shell installer and a PowerShell installer. You can also build from source with cargo build --release.\"\n                }\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    </script>\n    <script>\n      // Set the theme before first paint to avoid a flash of the wrong theme.\n      (function () {\n        try {\n          var stored = localStorage.getItem('niki-theme');\n          var theme =\n            stored ||\n            (window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches ? 'dark' : 'light');\n          document.documentElement.dataset.theme = theme;\n        } catch (e) {\n          document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'light';\n        }\n      })();\n    </script>\n    <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/assets/index-q2vnsdpM.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin href=\"/assets/index-BZTM8ZY_.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n", "erro": "", "ms": 817}